INSERT INTO "collections" ("id","slug","title","intro","sort_order","published","updated_at") VALUES('mens-jewellery','mens-jewellery','Men''s Jewellery','',8,1,'2026-08-18 15:04:30');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('ratneshvari','ratneshvari','Ratneshvari','The Queen of Jewels','bridal-necklace','A celebration of India''s timeless royal jewellery tradition, Ratneshvari is an extraordinary choker crafted in 22-carat gold, illuminated by the natural depth of emeralds and the soft, luminous beauty of real pearls. At the centre lies a sculpted emerald, framed within an intricate architecture of gold and surrounded by a constellation of finely set stones. From this magnificent centre, layers of pearls and emeralds descend in graceful symmetry, meeting ornate gold motifs inspired by the grandeur of traditional Indian craftsmanship. The matching earrings echo the same royal vocabulary — carved emeralds, intricate goldwork and cascading drops — creating a complete ensemble that feels at once ceremonial, opulent and unmistakably heirloom. The richness of 22-carat gold brings warmth to the composition, while the deep green of the emeralds and the natural lustre of the pearls create a striking contrast. Every element has been brought together to celebrate the beauty of craftsmanship that was never meant to be rushed, mass-produced or forgotten.',0,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-24 07:06:54',NULL,'35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('navratna-rajshri','navratna-rajshri','Navratna Rajshri','The Royal Splendour of the Nine Gems','bridal-necklace','Rooted in one of India''s most enduring jewellery traditions, Navratna Rajshri celebrates the sacred harmony of the nine precious gemstones, each representing a celestial force and brought together in a composition of timeless elegance. Crafted in 22-carat gold, the necklace is formed through delicate strands of lustrous pearls, punctuated by nine richly coloured gemstones — each chosen for its distinctive character and brilliance. At the centre, a deep red ruby commands attention, while emerald, sapphire, yellow sapphire, coral and the remaining Navratna stones create a vivid constellation of colour along the necklace. Intricate gold detailing, natural pearls and finely finished settings give the piece an unmistakable sense of heritage, while its graceful silhouette allows the richness of the stones to remain the focus. The matching earrings complete the ensemble, carrying the same arrangement of gemstones, pearls and gold craftsmanship in a refined expression of traditional Indian jewellery. More than an ornament, Navratna Rajshri is a celebration of balance, tradition and auspiciousness — a jewel conceived in the spirit of India''s royal heritage and made to become an heirloom for generations.',1,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-24 07:08:55',NULL,'35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('shri-lakshmi-vaibhav','shri-lakshmi-vaibhav','Shri Lakshmi Vaibhav','The Splendour of Goddess Lakshmi','bridal-necklace','A magnificent expression of India''s sacred jewellery tradition, Shri Lakshmi Vaibhav draws inspiration from the grandeur of South Indian temple ornaments, where gold was created not merely as adornment, but as an offering to divinity. At its centre, Goddess Lakshmi presides over an elaborate composition of sculpted gold, surrounded by intricate floral, peacock and temple-inspired motifs. Every surface is richly worked, creating the depth and architectural character traditionally associated with temple jewellery. Deep green emerald drops punctuate the warm richness of the gold, while delicate ruby accents bring touches of colour and auspicious brilliance to the composition. The matching earrings continue the same devotional language, carrying the central goddess motif into a complete ceremonial ensemble. The result is a jewel of extraordinary presence — opulent yet deeply rooted in tradition, designed to evoke the splendour of temple architecture translated into gold. A celebration of Lakshmi, prosperity and timeless Indian craftsmanship — created as an heirloom to be treasured, worn and passed down through generations.',2,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('kanakprabha','kanakprabha','Kanakprabha','The Radiance of Gold','bridal-necklace','A celebration of the grandeur of Indian bridal jewellery, Kanakprabha is an expression of craftsmanship in its most opulent form — where layers of richly worked gold come together to create a jewel of remarkable depth, detail and presence. The sweeping choker is built around intricate gold filigree and sculptural detailing, arranged in successive layers that create a beautifully architectural silhouette. Delicate pink stones add a soft, regal contrast to the warmth of the gold, while cascading emerald drops bring a deep green brilliance to the composition. At its centre, an intricately worked medallion provides the focal point, surrounded by finely detailed motifs that echo the ornamental language of traditional Indian jewellery. The matching earrings carry the same vocabulary of goldwork, gemstones and delicate drops, completing the ensemble with perfect symmetry. There is an unmistakable richness to Kanakprabha — the kind that comes not from excess, but from the patience and precision of the craftsman. Every curve, granulation and setting contributes to a jewel designed to be admired at close distance and remembered for generations. A jewel of enduring Indian grandeur — created for the bride who wears tradition not as a memory, but as a legacy.',3,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-23 19:28:01',NULL,'35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('astoria','astoria','Astoria','Diamond Halo Statement Ring','engagement-rings','A sophisticated expression of modern luxury, Astoria features a brilliant round centre diamond framed by a sculptural arrangement of baguette-cut and pavé diamonds. Set against a warm gold band, the contrasting tones create a refined two-tone effect while adding exceptional dimension and brilliance. Elegant yet distinctive, Astoria is designed for those who appreciate classic diamond jewellery with a contemporary edge.',4,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-09-01 18:01:01',NULL,'35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('elysia','elysia','Elysia','Classic Solitaire Diamond Ring','engagement-rings','Pure, elegant and effortlessly timeless, Elysia places a brilliant princess-cut centre diamond at the heart of a refined gold setting. The clean four-prong design allows the stone to command attention while the polished band keeps the overall silhouette beautifully understated. A modern expression of the solitaire — refined enough for everyday wear and significant enough to become an heirloom.',5,1,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('fleure','fleure','Fleuré','Diamond Floral Cocktail Ring','commitment-rings','A contemporary interpretation of the classic floral jewel, Fleuré is composed of layered petals crafted in white and rose-toned metal, each illuminated by a delicate pavé of diamonds. The dimensional arrangement gives the flower remarkable volume, while the mixed-metal finish adds warmth and modern sophistication. A statement ring designed to feel artistic, feminine and unmistakably luxurious.',6,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('celeste','celeste','Celeste','Three-Stone Diamond Ring','engagement-rings','Timeless in silhouette yet unmistakably luxurious, Celeste features a brilliant centre diamond complemented by two pear-shaped side stones, creating a graceful three-stone composition. The diamonds are held in a refined white-metal setting that allows each stone to capture and reflect the light from every angle. Elegant, symbolic, and effortlessly sophisticated, Celeste is a modern classic designed to last beyond trends.',7,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('seraphine','seraphine','Seraphine','Ruby & Diamond Sculptural Earrings','earrings','Bold yet beautifully fluid, Seraphine is defined by sweeping curves of rich ruby tones intertwined with brilliant diamond accents. The elongated open silhouette creates an illusion of movement, while the alternating bands of colour and light give the earrings remarkable depth. A contemporary statement designed for the woman who prefers jewellery with presence, individuality and effortless elegance.',8,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('elara','elara','Elara','Gold Cascade Earrings','earrings','Elara brings together polished gold, delicate architectural detailing and a series of fine cascading chains that move beautifully with the wearer. The sculptural gold dome creates a striking focal point, while the graduated chains add length, fluidity and an understated sense of drama. A distinctive pair for those who appreciate contemporary jewellery with a touch of timeless glamour.',9,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('aurelia','aurelia','Aurelia','Golden Pearl Drop Earrings','earrings','Aurelia pairs luminous golden-toned pearl drops with refined diamond-set detailing for a look that is both graceful and luxurious. The clean geometric upper setting provides a modern contrast to the soft, rounded pearls, creating a beautifully balanced composition. Elegant enough for evening occasions yet refined enough for everyday luxury, Aurelia is a timeless addition to any fine jewellery collection.',10,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-24 07:15:40',NULL,'35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('serenity','serenity','Serenity','Emerald Peacock Drop Earrings','earrings','An unexpected meeting of colour, craftsmanship and playful elegance, Serenity features richly coloured emerald-cut green gemstones paired with intricately sculpted peacock motifs. Brilliant diamond accents highlight the detailed goldwork, while delicate ornamental drops complete the elongated silhouette. A distinctive statement pair created for those who seek fine jewellery with personality and an artistic point of view.',11,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('saanvi','saanvi','Saanvi','Golden Jhumka Earrings','earrings','Inspired by the enduring beauty of traditional Indian jhumkas, Saanvi transforms a timeless silhouette into an expression of sculptural gold craftsmanship. Intricately textured floral tops flow into graduated bell-shaped forms, creating depth and movement while maintaining the warmth and richness of gold. A classic statement designed to celebrate Indian heritage with an elegant, contemporary finish.',12,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('valentine','valentine','Valentine','Ruby Floral Drop Earrings','earrings','A romantic celebration of colour and brilliance, Valentine features vivid ruby-toned gemstones arranged in an elegant floral silhouette, finished with graceful pear-shaped drops. Surrounded by a delicate diamond halo, each gemstone catches the light beautifully, creating a rich contrast between deep crimson colour and icy brilliance. A statement pair designed to bring sophistication and drama to any occasion.',13,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('verona','verona','Verona','Emerald Diamond Drop Earrings','earrings','Striking emeralds take centre stage in Verona, framed by a refined halo of brilliant diamonds and topped with an intricate floral-inspired motif. The deep green of the emeralds creates a luxurious contrast against the cool brilliance of the diamond setting. Finished with a clean, elongated silhouette, Verona is an elegant statement piece that transitions effortlessly from evening glamour to sophisticated occasion wear.',14,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:04:30','2026-08-18 15:04:30',NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('8d278848-7570-437c-b9ee-8d4cf294d52d','diamonds','Étoile Fine','Emerald-Cut Elegance, Finely Strung','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Étoile Fine is a delicate diamond bracelet designed around a narrow line of brilliant white stones. The diamonds are spaced or closely articulated along the central structure, creating a restrained trail of sparkle rather than the substantial visual weight of a full tennis bracelet. The cool white-metal appearance keeps the diamonds crisp and luminous.\n\n Its fine proportions are the defining feature. The bracelet is light enough for everyday wear and discreet enough to sit beside a watch or other bracelets without competing for attention. Yet the continuous presence of diamonds gives it a distinctly fine-jewellery finish. \n\nÉtoile Fine is especially effective as a layering piece. Worn alone, it reads as quiet luxury; worn with gold, rose gold or additional diamond bracelets, it becomes a subtle line of light that helps connect a larger wrist stack. It is understated diamond jewellery with an emphasis on elegance and versatility.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-18 15:24:57','2026-08-24 18:50:22','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('3a53832a-a6ad-4e6c-a12a-dd9645daaecb','kanakprabha-2','Lucienne','Matte Gold, One Sharp Detail','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Lucienne takes the wide bangle silhouette and strips it back to its essentials. A brushed, satin-finished gold band forms the base — flat, substantial, and deliberately unembellished — broken only by a single baguette-diamond square set flush into the surface. The channel-set baguettes catch light in a way the matte gold doesn''t, creating quiet contrast rather than competing sparkle. A ridged gold hinge sits just beside the setting, adding a small structural detail to an otherwise clean line.\n\nThe result is a bangle that reads as modern and architectural — understated enough for daily wear, with just enough brilliance to keep it from being plain.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-23 20:20:57','2026-08-24 18:58:42','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('3127a035-c09f-454f-adad-dfcd4d4be565','3','Sapphire Étoile','Star-Set Sapphires, Diamond-Bound','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Sapphire Étoile gives the classic tennis bracelet a deeper, more dramatic palette by combining brilliant white diamonds with rich blue sapphires. The bracelet follows a continuous articulated construction, allowing the stones to curve naturally around the wrist while maintaining a precise, jewellery-set appearance. \n\nThe diamonds provide the bright, icy scintillation associated with a traditional tennis bracelet, while the deep blue sapphire accents introduce a strong contrast that breaks up the continuous field of white brilliance. The setting appears in a cool white-metal tone, allowing both the diamonds and sapphires to remain crisp and vivid.\n\n Sapphire Étoile is more expressive than a conventional all-diamond tennis bracelet. It retains the elegance and flexibility of the classic form, but the blue stones give it greater depth and personality — particularly effective for evening wear or as a distinctive alternative to an entirely diamond-set bracelet.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:23:33','2026-08-24 18:47:45','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('045562b4-81f6-4907-a608-435159cdb60e','4','Woven Aurum','Watchful Eyes','mens-jewellery',replace('Woven Aurum is a substantial yellow-gold bracelet whose identity comes from its tactile, woven construction. Rounded and interlocking gold elements create a continuous braided surface around the wrist, producing both volume and movement without relying on diamonds or coloured gemstones. \n\nThe warm yellow-gold tone gives the bracelet a rich, traditional appearance, while the repeated woven pattern introduces a more contemporary sense of texture. Light travels across the individual links and recessed areas, making the bracelet appear to change subtly as it moves. \n\nThis is a piece for someone who wants the presence of a heavy gold bracelet without the formal language of gemstone jewellery. Woven Aurum can be worn as a single statement piece, where its texture becomes the focus, or combined with slimmer bangles for contrast. Its strength is unmistakably in the gold itself — substantial, tactile and visually confident.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:23:56','2026-08-24 18:53:16','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('0f885932-7447-4368-a6b6-df9d4c85afe8','5','Emerald Royale','An Emerald Court, in Bloom','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Emerald Royale is built around the saturated green of an emerald, using the gemstone as a strong vertical centre within a substantial diamond-set frame. The emerald''s deep green colour provides the primary visual focus, while brilliant white diamonds surround and flank it, creating a bright contrast that makes the central stone appear even more vivid. \n\nThe setting combines warm yellow-gold elements with cooler white-metal diamond sections, giving the ring a refined two-tone appearance. The elongated proportions of the emerald and the surrounding diamond architecture make the piece feel tall and commanding on the finger rather than delicate\n\n. Emerald Royale is unmistakably a statement ring. It is suited to evening and occasion dressing, where the contrast of green gemstone, white diamonds and warm gold can be fully appreciated. The design has a classic gemstone-ring foundation, but its structured proportions give it a more contemporary, architectural personality.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:24:37','2026-08-24 18:51:58','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('863d3a69-8d14-4920-954c-13a00fc206c6','6','Aurum','A Line of Pear-Shaped Light','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Aurum presents the traditional tennis bracelet through a warmer lens. A continuous sequence of brilliant white diamonds runs around the wrist, closely set so that the stones read as an uninterrupted ribbon of light. The diamonds are framed in warm yellow gold, creating a richer contrast than the cool white-metal settings usually associated with the classic tennis silhouette. \n\nThe rounded brilliant-cut stones are arranged in a flexible articulated construction, allowing the bracelet to sit naturally against the wrist while preserving the visual continuity of the diamond line. The yellow-gold colour adds warmth and makes the piece feel particularly luxurious against the skin. \n\nAurum is a versatile statement of classic diamond jewellery. It has the recognisable elegance of a tennis bracelet, but the yellow-gold setting gives it a more traditional and opulent character. It can be worn alone as a signature bracelet or combined with simpler gold bangles for a richer stack.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:24:54','2026-08-24 18:48:49','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('094d875c-d8e7-4fd7-9bf1-796d300eab31','7','Rosé Lumière','The Classic, Reimagined in Rosé','everyday-jewellery',replace('Rosé Lumière reinterprets the tennis bracelet in warm rose gold, pairing the soft blush tone of the metal with a continuous line of brilliant white diamonds. The diamonds are closely set along the articulated bracelet, creating a bright, uninterrupted trail of sparkle around the wrist. \n\nThe contrast is subtle but effective: the cool brilliance of the diamonds is softened by the pink warmth of the rose-gold setting, giving the familiar tennis silhouette a more contemporary and romantic personality. The flexible construction allows the bracelet to follow the wrist naturally while keeping the diamond line visually continuous. \n\nRosé Lumière is an elegant alternative to the classic white-metal tennis bracelet. It retains the timeless sophistication of a diamond line while introducing colour through the metal rather than through gemstones. Worn alone it has immediate refinement; layered with other rose-gold jewellery, it becomes the luminous centre of a coordinated stack.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:25:27','2026-08-24 18:56:02','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('ef2bfae5-4fc4-4e3f-9b8c-10a9b10c018f','8','Verdelle','Open Gold, Emerald Tipped','everyday-jewellery',replace('Verdelle is a minimalist open cuff in warm rose gold, finished at each end with contrasting green gemstones. The slim bracelet keeps the metalwork deliberately restrained so that the colour of the stones becomes the principal visual accent. The blush tone of the rose gold provides a soft background against which the deeper green reads clearly. \n\nThe open construction gives Verdelle a modern, sculptural character and makes the bracelet visually lighter than a fully enclosed bangle. The green stones act almost like two small focal points, balancing one another across the wrist while the rose-gold arms create a clean frame. \n\nVerdelle is particularly suited to contemporary occasion dressing, but its minimal scale also makes it approachable for everyday wear. It is a good example of colour-led jewellery where the design does not need a large amount of metal or diamonds to create impact.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:25:49','2026-08-24 18:55:03','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('a917db8d-52b4-420a-9831-b8836c329e14','9','Rubelle','Pearls Interrupted by Ruby','diamond-necklace',replace('Rubelle combines the softness of natural-looking creamy pearls with the saturated red of ruby-toned gemstones, creating a compact necklace and earring ensemble with a distinctly occasion-wear character. The necklace is built around a graceful pearl strand, interrupted by larger ruby-coloured stones framed with bright diamond accents. The contrast between the gentle lustre of the pearls and the deeper red stones gives the composition both warmth and depth.\n\nThe matching earrings echo the same language, pairing ruby centres with luminous pearl drops and diamond detailing. Warm gold accents complete the setting and add another layer of richness to the colour palette.\n\nRubelle is elegant without being excessively large, making it particularly suitable for weddings, festive occasions and formal daytime events. The combination of pearls, ruby tones and gold creates a traditional jewellery vocabulary, while the clean arrangement keeps the overall impression polished and refined.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:26:21','2026-08-24 18:54:17','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
