INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('6d12b6d6-6902-40de-9ed9-e33cf4c3ef44','31','30','','mens-jewellery','',0,0,0,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:33:40','2026-08-24 11:41:28','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('61b6b0c2-bed8-4333-a17c-52b16672dc49','31-2','Asterion','An Expression of Balanced Brilliance','engagement-rings',replace('Asterion takes a distinctly refined approach to the diamond ring, using a warm yellow-gold band as the foundation for a balanced arrangement of round white diamonds. The circular stones create a continuous rhythm of brilliance across the setting, with each diamond contributing its own crisp flashes of light while maintaining the overall symmetry of the design.\n\nThe rounded silhouettes of the diamonds complement the softly curved profile of the yellow-gold band, creating a harmonious contrast between the bright, luminous stonework and the warmth of the metal. Rather than relying on a single dominant solitaire, Asterion builds its presence through the repetition, proportion and collective brilliance of the round diamonds.\n\nThe result is an elegant and sophisticated design that feels contemporary without becoming overly rigid. Its symmetrical composition and warm gold foundation give Asterion a polished, luxurious character, making it an excellent choice for someone drawn to refined jewellery with a sense of balance and understated glamour.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:34:01','2026-08-24 07:40:56','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('df9cfdda-b46d-4683-8705-31b7f8f5a94b','32','Leonis','### The Emblem of Sovereign Strength','mens-jewellery',replace('Leonis draws its character from the timeless language of the signet ring, combining bold yellow gold with the commanding presence of a sculpted lion\. At the centre, the lion’s head emerges in raised relief from a rectangular engraved panel, giving the ring a distinctly heraldic quality\. Its detailed mane and expressive features create a strong focal point, transforming the traditional signet silhouette into something more sculptural and imposing\.\n\nRadiating outward from the lion is a finely engraved sunburst pattern, filling the surrounding panel with lines that catch and reflect the light\. This framing detail gives the central emblem greater depth while reinforcing the sense of grandeur and ceremony\.\n\nThe shoulders introduce a contrasting geometric language\. Linear engraved borders transition into angular triangular motifs, creating a rhythmic pattern along each side of the ring\. These sharp forms balance the organic character of the lion, bringing a more contemporary and architectural dimension to the otherwise classical design\.\n\nThe substantial yellow\-gold construction completes the aesthetic, giving Leonis a warm, commanding presence\. Rather than relying on diamonds for its impact, the ring derives its luxury from **sculpture, engraving, symmetry and craftsmanship**\.\n\nLeonis is a statement of strength and distinction — a piece designed to feel less like an ornament and more like a personal emblem, carrying the visual authority of a traditional signet with a refined contemporary finish\.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:34:14','2026-08-24 07:40:49','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('81dfca51-38b2-46d2-8e49-fd43a423eb83','33','33','',NULL,'',0,0,0,NULL,'2026-08-24 07:34:32','2026-08-24 07:34:34','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('44a4f1ec-4290-4c2d-9fef-3cf7de1d1e2d','meridian','Meridian','Matte Gold, Precise Detail','everyday-jewellery',replace('Meridian is a clean, substantial band that lets the character of the metal do most of the work. The principal body is warm yellow gold, finished with a smooth, highly polished surface, while narrow contrasting white-metal lines interrupt the band at measured intervals. These lighter accents create a restrained two-tone effect and give the otherwise simple ring a sharper, more contemporary rhythm. \n\nThere is no need for an elaborate gemstone centre here. Instead, the visual interest comes from the interplay of yellow gold and the cooler white-metal detailing, with each polished surface catching light differently as the ring moves.\n\n Meridian is particularly suited to someone who prefers understated jewellery with considered detailing: substantial enough to feel luxurious, but disciplined enough to remain versatile for everyday wear or as part of a modern wedding-band collection.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 08:31:05','2026-08-24 18:33:30','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('a0574c77-a3c5-425d-80a8-0de5c98e0cd8','omkara','Omkara','traditional presence','mens-jewellery',replace('Omkara is a substantial yellow-gold signet ring built around symbolism rather than conventional diamond ornamentation. Its broad polished shoulders lead towards a compact raised face, where the sacred Om symbol forms the visual centre. The warm yellow-gold surface gives the ring a rich, traditional presence, while the darker central treatment creates a strong contrast that makes the emblem immediately legible.\n\n The signet construction gives Omkara a sense of permanence: it is a piece designed to feel personal and substantial on the hand rather than delicate or purely decorative. The clean outer profile also allows the engraved or applied symbol to remain the focus. \n\nOmkara sits comfortably between heritage jewellery and contemporary signet design — a confident piece whose character comes from its gold, its symbolism and its unmistakable silhouette.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 11:41:38','2026-08-24 18:31:56','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('1c75589b-3979-42ec-a2ed-779e327ab763','rosaline','Rosaline','Diamonds, Uninterrupted','mens-jewellery',replace('Rosaline is a fluid bracelet built from closely articulated links in warm rose gold. The copper-rich blush of the metal gives the piece a softer, more contemporary character than traditional yellow gold, while the repeated link construction creates movement and a gentle sense of volume around the wrist. \n\nSmall dark accents appear within the link pattern, adding contrast to the rose-gold surface and breaking up what could otherwise be a completely uniform chain. The result is a bracelet that feels more dimensional and jewellery-led than a basic chain, without becoming overly formal. \n\nThe construction is its defining feature: each link contributes to the bracelet''s flexibility, allowing the silhouette to follow the wrist naturally. Rosaline works especially well as a statement everyday bracelet, with enough warmth and texture to be worn alone and enough visual rhythm to sit comfortably alongside other rose-gold pieces.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 17:58:14','2026-08-24 18:34:44','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('9d1ab173-75f8-4406-8675-7367b3be26fe','lumine','Luminé','',NULL,'',0,0,0,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:01:39','2026-08-24 18:03:58','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('e844d930-3364-43d7-9750-1f8ba32352a9','lumine-2','Luminé','Two Tones, One Rhythm','mens-jewellery',replace('Luminé is an exercise in delicate simplicity, built around a fine two-tone chain that weaves white and yellow gold together link by link. Rather than relying on stones for sparkle, the design lets the interplay of metals do the work — each tone catching light differently, creating a subtle, continuous shimmer along the neckline that shifts and reads elegantly from every angle. The scale is intentionally fine and closely knit, giving the necklace a refined presence rather than a heavy statement effect. The contrast between the cool white gold and warm yellow gold is the focal point, allowing the craftsmanship of the chain itself to take centre stage.\n\nThe silhouette is exceptionally versatile. Worn alone, Luminé provides quiet polish; layered with other necklaces, its fine scale allows it to become the luminous foundation of a more elaborate arrangement. It is understated two-tone gold jewellery designed for frequent wear rather than occasional display.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:04:08','2026-08-24 18:31:13','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('cce42a48-beef-4360-8c7b-e9e1649c1108','suryarekha','Suryarekha','Etched Gold, Effortless Shine','mens-jewellery',replace('Suryarekha is a slim yellow-gold bangle distinguished by a repeated textured surface that gives the metal a finely worked, almost engraved appearance. The underlying silhouette remains clean and circular, but the patterned treatment catches the light across the circumference, creating a soft shimmer as the wrist moves. \n\nIts appeal lies in the contrast between polished gold edges and the more tactile patterned sections. Instead of relying on gemstones, the bangle uses craftsmanship and surface treatment to create visual depth, making the piece feel richer than its relatively restrained form suggests. \n\nThe warm yellow-gold colour gives Suryarekha a classic Indian-jewellery sensibility, while the narrow profile keeps it contemporary and easy to stack. It is the kind of bangle that can function as a quiet standalone piece or become part of a larger collection of mixed textures and gold tones.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:05:47','2026-08-24 18:35:41','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('80dfceb4-4d88-453d-b413-01b8643fe8bf','fleuria','Fleuria','A Flower in Bloom, A Leaf in Motion','commitment-rings',replace('Fleuria turns the traditional floral motif into an open, sculptural ring. Two yellow-gold bands sweep around the finger in a bypass construction, creating a sense of movement before rising towards a pair of diamond-set floral forms. Brilliant white diamonds are arranged in compact petal-like clusters, giving the flower heads their luminous centre and making the design sparkle from multiple directions. \n\nThe warm yellow gold provides a rich frame for the diamonds without overwhelming them. Because the ring remains open through the centre, the design feels lighter and more dynamic than a fully enclosed cocktail ring, while the crossing bands give it a distinctive three-dimensional profile.\n\n Fleuria is feminine without being delicate, and decorative without becoming excessively ornate. It is particularly suited to occasion wear, where the floral diamond clusters can act as the focal point while the bypass silhouette gives the piece a contemporary edge.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:07:31','2026-08-24 18:36:35','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('00e3cf23-e441-473e-98f8-d18f2c921218','e-lan','Élan','Precision in a Row','commitment-rings',replace('Élan is defined by contrast: a warm yellow-gold outer band surrounds a crisp white-metal channel carrying a disciplined row of baguette-cut white diamonds. The rectangular diamonds are arranged edge to edge, producing a continuous architectural line across the face of the ring. Their step-cut facets create controlled flashes of light, giving the piece a sophisticated, almost tailored quality.\n\n The white-metal diamond channel acts as a visual inset against the yellow gold, creating a clear two-tone composition rather than simply mixing metals for decoration. The result is clean, substantial and distinctly modern.\n\nÉlan is a strong choice for someone who likes diamond jewellery with structure. The design has enough brilliance to read as luxurious, but the straight geometry keeps it restrained and wearable. It could sit comfortably within a contemporary wedding-band collection or be worn alone as a statement of polished, modern taste.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:08:49','2026-08-24 18:37:43','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('c45772b4-f364-4867-89af-1e4b157419b5','seraphine-2','Seraphine','A Curve Around Every Cluster','commitment-rings',replace('Seraphine uses sweeping yellow-gold curves to frame a compact cluster of brilliant white diamonds. The bypass construction allows the two sides of the ring to approach one another without fully closing around the finger, creating an open silhouette with a pronounced sense of movement. At the centre, the diamonds are grouped closely enough to read as one luminous focal point rather than as isolated stones. \n\nThe brilliance of the round-cut diamonds contrasts with the smooth, reflective yellow gold, producing a warm-versus-cool effect that gives the ring considerable depth. The gold curves also act almost like a frame, directing the eye towards the stone cluster.\n\nSeraphine is a more sculptural alternative to a conventional cluster ring. It has the sparkle expected from diamond jewellery, but its real character comes from the flowing construction — a piece designed to look dimensional and elegant rather than simply traditional.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:10:21','2026-08-24 18:38:35','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('75b9702e-2c43-4356-9329-ac82255f12c9','virelle','Virelle','A Single Flourish in Gold','bracelets-and-bangles',replace('Virelle is a fine yellow-gold bangle whose appeal comes from a deliberately ornamental front section. The slim circular body keeps the piece light and elegant, while the decorative goldwork introduces curling, floral and leaf-like forms that interrupt the clean line of the bangle.\n\n The design is primarily metal-led, with the warm yellow-gold surface providing both colour and ornament. Any small stone-like highlights are secondary to the sculpted gold detailing, which gives the bangle its character and makes it feel more like a miniature piece of jewellery architecture than a plain gold circle.\n\n Because the bracelet remains narrow, the decoration does not become heavy. Virelle is well suited to stacking, where its ornamental section can sit beside simpler bangles and create contrast. It also works beautifully on its own when the intention is quiet, traditional elegance rather than overt diamond glamour.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:11:31','2026-08-24 18:39:22','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('e2ac95a9-cd3a-4f41-bb21-7c24369676bb','axis','Axis','Angular Form, Latticed Soul','everyday-jewellery',replace('Axis approaches the classic gold ring through geometry. The body is formed in warm yellow gold with a broad, clean profile, while the upper section introduces subtle diamond detailing within an angular, structured composition. The diamonds provide points of white brilliance against the richer tone of the gold, but the overall design remains firmly metal-led. \n\nThe geometry is what gives Axis its contemporary personality. Instead of a raised solitaire or traditional cluster, the ring creates interest through straight edges, controlled proportions and the meeting of polished surfaces. This gives it a modern architectural quality while keeping the piece substantial enough to feel like fine jewellery.\n\n Axis is suited to a wearer who prefers understated luxury with a little visual tension. It can function as a sophisticated everyday ring, but its strong silhouette also gives it enough presence to sit comfortably within a more formal jewellery wardrobe.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:13:10','2026-08-24 18:25:12','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('a274e79a-3463-40ad-82ba-d286aa085450','celestine','Celestine','Marquise & Pear, Matched i  light','diamond-necklace',replace('Celestine is a refined yellow-gold necklace built around a small circular drop, with a delicate diamond-set accent that brings a concentrated point of brilliance to the centre. The pendant remains intentionally restrained, allowing the fine chain and open space around it to preserve a sense of lightness. \n\nThe white diamonds provide a cool, crisp sparkle against the warm yellow-gold setting. Rather than using a large central stone, the design relies on proportion: a modest amount of diamond, carefully placed, is enough to catch the light and give the necklace its jewellery character.\n\n Celestine is the kind of piece that works across occasions. It can sit neatly at the base of the neck for an understated look, or be layered with finer chains without becoming visually crowded. Its appeal is quiet and polished — a small diamond accent framed by the enduring warmth of yellow gold.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:14:06','2026-08-24 18:24:22','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('7cb57486-d9b6-4e33-b9b7-c1192b5ac891','turavia','Turavia','Turquoise Framed in Precision','diamond-necklace',replace('Turavia brings the strong geometry of Art-Deco jewellery into a vivid turquoise-and-white composition. The necklace and matching earrings are built around saturated blue-green turquoise cabochons, framed by bright white diamond accents and cool-toned metal. The contrast between the opaque turquoise and the scintillating surrounding stones gives the set an immediate graphic quality. \n\nThe central pendant is elongated and architectural, with stepped and symmetrical outlines that echo classic Art-Deco design. Smaller turquoise stations repeat along the necklace chain, creating a visual rhythm that connects the pendant to the rest of the composition. The matching earrings carry the same geometric language, making the ensemble feel deliberately unified.\n\n Turavia is a statement set rather than a minimalist one. Its appeal comes from colour, symmetry and contrast — an elegant choice for evening dressing when a jewel is intended to become the focal point of the look.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:16:43','2026-08-24 18:40:14','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('7284d06e-606c-455c-877e-8c20deb69752','rajrubi','Rajrubi','Bridal Grandeur, Set in Red','bridal-necklace',replace('Rajrubi is a richly ornamental bridal ensemble built around deep ruby-red gemstones, brilliant white diamonds and warm yellow-gold detailing. The necklace fans outward from the neckline in successive graduated strands, with pear-shaped and oval ruby-toned stones suspended along the lower edge to create a dramatic cascading fringe.\n\nThe diamonds form delicate halos and connecting links around the coloured stones, introducing a bright, icy contrast to the saturated crimson of the rubies. The warm yellow gold further intensifies the red tones, giving the entire set a regal, traditional character. Matching earrings echo the same pear-shaped ruby drops and diamond framing. \n\nRajrubi is unmistakably ceremonial. It is designed for the visual richness of bridal and formal wear, where the movement of the cascading drops becomes part of the jewellery''s effect. The result is a grand, feminine set with strong Indian occasion-wear appeal.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:17:35','2026-08-24 18:41:26','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('d74dfd51-25d7-4c64-96f3-6b1df4ae1482','rajrubi-2','Rajrubi','Regal Rubies, Cascading Light','diamond-necklace',replace('Rajrubi is a richly ornamental bridal ensemble built around deep ruby-red gemstones, brilliant white diamonds and warm yellow-gold detailing. The necklace fans outward from the neckline in successive graduated strands, with pear-shaped and oval ruby-toned stones suspended along the lower edge to create a dramatic cascading fringe.\n\n The diamonds form delicate halos and connecting links around the coloured stones, introducing a bright, icy contrast to the saturated crimson of the rubies. The warm yellow gold further intensifies the red tones, giving the entire set a regal, traditional character. Matching earrings echo the same pear-shaped ruby drops and diamond framing. \n\nRajrubi is unmistakably ceremonial. It is designed for the visual richness of bridal and formal wear, where the movement of the cascading drops becomes part of the jewellery''s effect. The result is a grand, feminine set with strong Indian occasion-wear appeal.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:18:35','2026-08-24 18:40:48','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('e18316a2-780a-491a-896d-268f960305e1','aureline','Aureline','A Chain With Character','mens-jewellery',replace('Aureline is a substantial yellow-gold necklace formed from a sequence of articulated geometric links. Each link is broad enough to read clearly across the neckline, yet the repeated construction keeps the silhouette fluid rather than rigid. The polished yellow gold gives the necklace a rich, traditional warmth. \n\nThere are no gemstones competing for attention; the design is deliberately focused on the quality, colour and rhythm of the gold. Subtle changes in surface and the articulation between links create flashes of light as the necklace moves, giving the piece a luxurious finish without requiring diamonds.\n\n Aureline is a versatile statement chain for someone who prefers strong gold jewellery. It can anchor a simple outfit on its own or become the foundation for a pendant or layered necklace arrangement. Its combination of substantial scale and clean geometry gives it a timeless character that sits comfortably between classic and contemporary styling.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:19:42','2026-08-24 18:42:22','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('c1463721-eb61-4aa7-852c-abb5a77120ea','rose-va','Roséva','Curb Links,LoudContrast','mens-jewellery',replace('Roséva takes the classic statement chain and softens it through the use of rose gold. The necklace is constructed from closely interlocking links, creating a broad, fluid silhouette with a substantial presence across the neckline. The blush-pink warmth of rose gold gives the piece a more contemporary and romantic character than the stronger yellow tone of traditional gold. \n\nSmall dark decorative accents appear across portions of the links, adding contrast and giving the chain additional visual texture. Rather than functioning as a gemstone necklace, Roséva is primarily a study in metal, scale and link construction.\n\n The substantial profile makes it a statement piece, but the articulated chain keeps it wearable and natural against the body. Roséva is particularly effective with evening or modern occasion dressing, where the warm rose-gold colour can introduce softness without sacrificing the confidence of a bold necklace.','\n',char(10)),0,0,1,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:21:01','2026-08-24 18:28:08','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
INSERT INTO "pieces" ("id","slug","name","subtitle","collection_id","description","sort_order","featured","published","deleted_at","created_at","updated_at","created_by","updated_by") VALUES('b2e84c64-4db4-4558-80d2-52fd763fd6b1','ce-leste','Céleste','',NULL,'',0,0,0,NULL,'2026-08-24 18:44:14','2026-08-24 18:44:14','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0','35795183-f2f6-4de3-8573-463a9b9718c0');
